 "notes": [
  "Old 2002 PC sheet decorated with Clone Wars stickers that cover the (V) column and some line numbers; a small \"v\" after a card name read as (V).",
  "Name written \"Brian Herold AKA Dong Henley\" (same player as p22, which says \"AKA J.O. Simpson\").",
  "Margin text is a protest/joke (\"Animated gifs are not a crime. Listen to the players.\") plus a made-up card \"A Dark Time For The Rebellion (V) 4 USED INTERRUPT\"; not part of the deck.",
  "UNSURE: line 21 \"Blind Jedi\" -> Rahm Kota, Blind Jedi; line 22 \"Fallen Jedi\" -> Maris Brood, Fallen Jedi",
  "UNSURE: shield 12 \"Jabba's Prize\" written in the shield slots (wiki: Jabba's Prize/Jabba's Prize, Virtual Block 6)"
 ]
